<h1><span class="sr">Takudzwa Muzovaka: </span>Turning<br>Ideas into<br><em>Impact</em></h1>
<p class="sub">Computer Science &amp; AI student, cybersecurity enthusiast, researcher, author and entrepreneur building technology, ideas and solutions with purpose.</p>
