<section class="light" id="about"><div class="w"><div class="ab rv"><div class="ph"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Takudzwa Muzovaka in a navy patterned suit"><div class="q"><p>Technology, knowledge and purpose can change lives.</p><small>— Takudzwa Muzovaka</small></div></div>
<div><p class="lbl">About me</p><h2>Takudzwa Muzovaka</h2><p class="mut">I work where technology, artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, research, entrepreneurship and writing meet. I study Computer Science with a focus on AI and cybersecurity, build practical projects, and write to share what I learn. My aim is simple: create solutions and ideas that serve people and last.</p>
<ul class="facts"><li>Computer Science &amp; Engineering</li><li>AI / Machine Learning</li><li>Cybersecurity</li><li>Research</li><li>Entrepreneurship</li><li>Author</li></ul><a class="btn g" href="#journey">More about me <span>→</span></a></div></div></div></section>

<section class="dk2" id="values"><div class="w"><p class="lbl">What drives me</p><h2>Excellence with purpose</h2>
<div class="vals rv"><div><b>01</b><h3>Purpose</h3><p class="mut">I build with intention and seek meaningful impact.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Intelligence</h3><p class="mut">Continuous learning, research and understanding.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Innovation</h3><p class="mut">Turning ideas into practical solutions.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Excellence</h3><p class="mut">Maintaining high standards in what I build and create.</p></div></div></div></section>

<section class="dark" id="projects"><div class="w"><p class="lbl">Selected work</p><h2>Building at the intersection of technology, intelligence and impact.</h2><div class="pg" id="pg"></div></div></section>

<section class="light" id="writing"><div class="w"><p class="lbl">Writing &amp; ideas</p><h2>Ideas become powerful when they are written, shared and applied.</h2>
<div class="wr rv"><div class="bk"><img data-logo alt=""><div><h3>The Zimbabwean-India Dream</h3><small>A GUIDE FOR ZIMBABWEAN STUDENTS TO STUDY IN INDIA</small></div><small>TAKUDZWA MUZOVAKA</small></div>
<div><p class="lbl">Featured book</p><h2 style="font-size:34px">The Zimbabwean-India Dream</h2><p class="q2" style="color:var(--gd);font-size:22px;margin:0 0 12px">Written for Zimbabwean students who dream of studying in India.</p><p class="mut">A practical guide for Zimbabwean students who want to study in India, with real experiences, insights and steps to help you achieve your dream.</p>
<ul class="facts"><li>Practical guidance</li><li>Real experiences</li><li>Scholarships &amp; opportunities</li><li>Life in India</li></ul>
