<p style="margin-top:24px"><span class="lbl">Email</span><br><a id="em" href="#">[PLACEHOLDER — ADD EMAIL]</a></p><p style="margin-top:14px"><span class="lbl">Location</span><br>[PLACEHOLDER — ADD LOCATION]</p>
